				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:30:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T03:18:35" />
